@startuml class-diagram
skinparam defaultFontName VL Gothic

title 29_CompletableFutureDemo クラス図

class Main {
  +main(args: String[]): void
  ~run(scanner: Scanner, out: PrintStream, service: PriceComparisonService, fetchers: List<ShopPriceFetcher>): void
}

class PriceComparisonService {
  -executor: Executor
  -timeout: Duration
  +PriceComparisonService(executor: Executor, timeout: Duration)
  +compareAsync(productName: String, fetchers: List<ShopPriceFetcher>): CompletableFuture<List<PriceQuote>>
  +cheapestOf(quotes: List<PriceQuote>): Optional<PriceQuote>
  +findCheapestAsync(productName: String, fetchers: List<ShopPriceFetcher>): CompletableFuture<PriceQuote>
}

interface ShopPriceFetcher {
  +shopName(): String
  +fetchPrice(productName: String): int
}

class SimulatedShopPriceFetcher implements ShopPriceFetcher {
  -shopName: String
  -price: int
  -delayMillis: long
  -shouldFail: boolean
  +fetchPrice(productName: String): int
}

class PriceQuote << record >> {
  +shopName: String
  +price: Integer
  +status: Status
}

enum "PriceQuote.Status" as Status {
  OK
  FAILED
  TIMEOUT
}

class ShopUnavailableException extends RuntimeException {
  +ShopUnavailableException(shopName: String)
}

class NoAvailablePriceException extends RuntimeException {
  +NoAvailablePriceException(productName: String)
}

Main "1" --> "1" PriceComparisonService : 利用する
PriceComparisonService "1" --> "0..*" ShopPriceFetcher : 並行に問い合わせる
PriceComparisonService ..> PriceQuote : 生成する
PriceComparisonService ..> NoAvailablePriceException : throwする(findCheapestAsync)
SimulatedShopPriceFetcher ..> ShopUnavailableException : throwする
PriceQuote "1" --> "1" Status : 状態を持つ

note right of PriceComparisonService
  各店舗の問い合わせをsupplyAsyncで並行実行し、
  orTimeoutでタイムアウト検出、exceptionallyで
  失敗/タイムアウトをPriceQuoteのFAILED/TIMEOUT
  状態に変換する(1店舗の失敗が全体に波及しない)。
end note

note right of SimulatedShopPriceFetcher
  実際の店舗API呼び出しの代わりにThread.sleepで
  遅延をシミュレートする実装。モックは使用しない。
end note

@enduml
